# 3. Scale up

## Diagram

```
                       User (browser)
                             |
                https://www.foobar.com (DNS)
                             |
          +------------------+------------------+
          |                                     |
+---------v----------+             +------------v-------+
| Load balancer 1    |<----------->| Load balancer 2    |
| (HAProxy)          |  cluster    | (HAProxy)          |
| active             | (heartbeat) | active / backup    |
+---------+----------+             +------------+-------+
          |                                     |
          +------------------+------------------+
                             |
                   +---------v---------+
                   |  Web server       |
                   |  (Nginx)          |
                   +---------+---------+
                             |
                   +---------v---------+
